# promise: #314
# The badge at the right end of ⌘T's field is Arc's "Site Control Center Button" (Arc's binary:
# "command bar placeholder button that opens site control center"). Pressing it closes the bar and
# opens the Site Control Center for the page in front. Until 0.1.37 it was a picture: a click did
# nothing (#314).
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=badge
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://action/newTab
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarBadge=1
wait 1
expect-log command bar badge: shown true, pressed true, bar closed, site control center shown
